{
  "description": "Label lists that differ between configurations, and the [<common>] + select({<key>: [<labels>]}) src/go/pkg/conditions splits them into. Each configuration's labels are those of every entry of labels whose when it includes, in order. Read by src/go/pkg/conditions, turnkey.cfg (src/python/cfg) and nix/buck2/platforms.nix alike, so the three can't drift apart; the last two only have os and cpu, so they skip cases with dimensions.",
